ool for educators, healthcare providers, and content creators.\n\n- Learn faster\n- Simplify concepts for learners and patients\n- Visualize concepts and structures \n- Stand out in your class \n- Build confidence for the OR\n\n7 Day Free Trial!  Subscription required.\n\nDisclaimer: Body Works does not make health-related claims or provide content related to the diagnosis, mitigation, cure, or treatment of a disease or medical condition; additionally, Body Works is not a medical device, medical content, or software for medical devices.", "short_description": "CREATE. EDUCATE. LEARN. SHARE - A virtual reality anatomy studio. \n\nDiscover a revolutionary virtual reality anatomy studio. Explain complex anatomy in minutes with simple, high-impact videos.\n\nBodyWorks is not a game.  It is a powerful tool for educators, healthcare providers, and content creators.  Check-in frequently for new anatomy and feature updates!\n\n7 Day Free Trial!  Subscription required."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.precisionostech.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.precisionostech.com/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "PrecisionOS Technology", "support_website_url": "https://support.precisionostech.com/knowledge", "website_url": "https://www.precisionostech.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "478089301798119"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SING